(NLP-Based Intelligent Web Application Development) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Project Title: NLP Assistant - Intelligent Chatbot and Text Analyzer) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Overview:) Tj
T*
(This Flask web application processes human language through typed text or browser voice input.) Tj
T*
(It returns chatbot responses, visible NLP analysis, speech output, and database-backed history.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Technology Stack:) Tj
T*
(- Frontend: HTML, CSS, Bootstrap, JavaScript) Tj
T*
(- Backend: Python Flask) Tj
T*
(- NLP: NLTK with rule-based fallbacks) Tj
T*
(- Database: SQLite runtime database and SQL export file) Tj
T*
(- Speech: Browser Web Speech API and Speech Synthesis API) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Implemented NLP Concepts:) Tj
T*
(1. Tokenization - displays tokenized user input.) Tj
T*
(2. Sentiment Analysis - classifies Positive, Negative, or Neutral.) Tj
T*
(3. Voice-to-Text - microphone input converts speech to text.) Tj
T*
(4. Text-to-Speech - Speak button reads chatbot output aloud.) Tj
T*
(5. Chatbot System - user vs bot interface with stored history.) Tj
T*
(6. Keyword Extraction - highlights important words from input.) Tj
T*
(7. Text Classification - labels messages as Complaint, Inquiry, Feedback, Command, or General.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(System Workflow:) Tj
T*
(User input -> JavaScript fetch request -> Flask route -> NLP engine -> database save -> JSON response -> UI display.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Database Table: chats) Tj
T*
(Fields: id, user_message, bot_response, tokens, keywords, sentiment, sentiment_score, classification, created_at.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(How to Run:) Tj
T*
(python3 -m venv .venv) Tj
T*
(source .venv/bin/activate) Tj
T*
(pip install -r requirements.txt) Tj
T*
(python3 app.py) Tj
T*
(Open http://127.0.0.1:5000) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Defense Demo Checklist:) Tj
T*
(Show chatbot, token list, sentiment result, keywords, classification, voice input, speech output, and history table.) Tj
T*
ET
